{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"没在想\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-1\",\n      \"text\": \"催逼停下来后，他发现自己舍不得的不是一时舒服，而是曾真心相信过的生活。\",\n      \"key\": \"真心相信\",\n      \"follows\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他盼着和人亲近时不必时时防备，也盼着珍惜的东西不用靠争抢才能留住。\",\n      \"key\": \"时时防备\",\n      \"follows\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他想付出时只是因为喜欢，不必反复证明自己值得被爱、被接纳，也不必先想着靠近会受伤。\",\n      \"key\": \"被爱接纳\",\n      \"follows\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他以前确实经历过那样的亲近，不愿只因眼下做不到，就把这份向往说成软弱。\",\n      \"key\": \"亲近经历\",\n      \"follows\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他不再急着证明自己有多坚强，也就不再把心里柔软看成会停步的危险。\",\n      \"key\": \"证明坚强\",\n      \"follows\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-8\",\n      \"text\": \"他允许自己去爱、去相信，不再要求这份向往立刻证明有用，也不拿它和责任比轻重。\",\n      \"key\": \"去爱相信\",\n      \"follows\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-6\",\n      \"text\": \"他终于明白，想要那种生活并不等于不肯承担眼前的事。\",\n      \"key\": \"承担眼前\",\n      \"follows\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-7\",\n      \"text\": \"他暂时不愿把心思拉回眼前的难处，因为他不想又把自己真正向往的生活搁到一边。\",\n      \"key\": \"搁到一边\",\n      \"follows\": true\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S06-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S06-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S06-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S06-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-4\",\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他因过去确实经历过那样的亲近而不愿贬低向往的判断，去掉对快乐的感受性表述。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-5\",\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他不再把柔软视为会妨碍行动的心理变化，去掉委屈和思念的听感复述。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-8\",\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他允许自己爱与相信、不再用实用性和责任衡量向往的选择，去掉先珍惜、不急于实现的听感近似表述。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-6\",\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"删去满足、柔软、盼望和疲惫的感受描写，改为说明他为何能不带亏欠地承认自己的向往。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-7\",\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他暂时回避眼前难处的心理动因，删去安宁和向往尚未实现的描述。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "22940c0f-8c1b-4cac-b9fd-c0909a589ae9", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T023442168445Z", "elapsed_seconds": 78.922, "completed_utc": "2026-10-30T02:36:01.432725+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d0bd811b2426a5b0011d0519e948c2584e2d0ad5f2074145dd9e09054d817c19", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kin